# The image is pinned to the exact version this recipe was validated against.
#
# Two things matter here:
#
#   1. `--safetensors-load-strategy eager` must be recognized. Older images
#      reject it as an unknown argument and the server never starts.
#   2. The combination of this image and GKE PodSnapshots was exercised
#      end to end on both L4 and H100 (checkpoint, restore, and inference on
#      the restored replica). Newer vLLM releases may well work, but they have
#      not been validated against the checkpoint/restore path, which is
#      sensitive to how the engine lays out CUDA state.
#
# The rest of the inference reference architecture tracks a newer default; that
# is deliberate. Bump this only after re-running the validation steps in the
# PodSnapshots guide.
CONTAINER_IMAGE_URL=docker.io/vllm/vllm-openai:v0.19.1
